Sajjad Dil Sambhalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
Daman Se Muh Chupalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
1.Bimar Kehraha Tha Aansu Baha Baha Kar<br>
Zainab Ka Sar Khula Hai Lakar Udhado Chadar<br>
Kufe Ke Rehne Walo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
2.Namoos-e-Mustafa Ku Kyun Dekhte Hu Aise<br>
Hairath Me Aasman Hai Tum Kalma Guh Hu Kaise<br>
Nazraen Zara Jukalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
3.Sajjad-e-Natawa Ke Pairou Me Bedhiyan Hai<br>
Majma Hai Kufioun Ka Sar Nange Bibiyan Hai<br>
Moula Ali Bachalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
4.Zainab Ka Naam Lekar Aada Pukarte They<br>
Reh Reh Ke Taziyane Abid Ku Marte They<br>
Jab Sheh Ke Rone Walo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
5.Barsat Pattharou Ki Kuthou Se Horahi Thi<br>
Zainab Ki Bekasi Par Tanhai Rorahi Thi<br>
Logo Diye Bhujado Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
6.Uothou Se Gir Rahe They Bache Jo Raste Me<br>
Matam Bapa Hai Peham Be Parda Bibiyun Me<br>
Ab Sar Pe Khakh Dalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya<br>
<br>
7.Rehan Kya Baya Hu Sajjad Ki Musibat<br>
Sehta Raha Jo Dil Par Har Har Khadam Aziyath<br>
Aankhou Se Khoon Bahalo Bazar-e-Shaam Aaya
